  "ruleText": "Plu 203.02 Construction of Rules. Parts Plu 203 - Plu 211 shall be construed to secure the just, accurate and efficient resolution of all disputes.\n\nSource. #2069, eff 7-1-82; ss by #2733, eff 5-31-84; ss by #4264, eff 6-8-87; ss by #5213, eff 8-28-91, EXPIRED: 8-28-97\n\nNew. #8464, eff 10-28-05",
